" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 90 gp / 170 gpHHonour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  90  gp /  170  gp<abbr title=\"Honour mode only\" class=\"bg3wiki-damage-rider-source nomobile\">H</abbr><sup class=\"mobileonly\">Honour</sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Frost_GenerateFrostOnDamage_Gloves</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Frost_GenerateFrostOnDamage_Gloves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Frost_GenerateFrostOnDamage_Gloves\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">e6bb26ab-2987-4061-9c5c-764b377f91b8</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e6bb26ab-2987-4061-9c5c-764b377f91b8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e6bb26ab-2987-4061-9c5c-764b377f91b8\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Frost_GenerateFrostOnDamage_Gloves</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Frost_GenerateFrostOnDamage_Gloves+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Frost_GenerateFrostOnDamage_Gloves+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>File</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Gloves_Leather_F</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Winter%27s_Clutches_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Winter's Clutches (passive feature)\">Winter's Clutches</a></dt><dd>When the wearer deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/24px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/37px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/24px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a> damage, inflict 2 turns of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Encrusted_with_Frost_(Condition)\" title=\"Encrusted with Frost (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Encrusted_with_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Encrusted_with_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/95/Encrusted_with_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Encrusted_with_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/95/Encrusted_with_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Encrusted_with_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Encrusted with Frost\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Encrusted_with_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Encrusted_with_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/95/Encrusted_with_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Encrusted_with_Frost_(Condition)\" title=\"Encrusted with Frost (Condition)\">Encrusted with Frost</a> upon the target(s).</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>: Given by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glut\" title=\"Glut\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png/25px-Portrait_Glut.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png/38px-Portrait_Glut.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png/50px-Portrait_Glut.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Glut\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png/25px-Portrait_Glut.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Glut\" title=\"Glut\">Glut</a> for completing <a href=\"/wiki/Avenge_Glut%27s_Circle\" title=\"Avenge Glut's Circle\">Avenge Glut's Circle</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Rosymorn_Monastery_Trail\" title=\"Rosymorn Monastery Trail\">Rosymorn Monastery Trail</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-43&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-129</span>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Esther\" title=\"Esther\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png/25px-Portrait_Esther.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png/38px-Portrait_Esther.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png/50px-Portrait_Esther.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lady Esther\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png/25px-Portrait_Esther.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Esther\" title=\"Esther\">Lady Esther</a>, north-east of the Trielta Crags waypoint</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Sundries\" title=\"Sorcerous Sundries\">Sorcerous Sundries</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-2&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-66</span>: On a counter behind a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lava_Elemental\" title=\"Lava Elemental\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Portrait_Lava_Elemental.png/25px-Portrait_Lava_Elemental.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Portrait_Lava_Elemental.png/38px-Portrait_Lava_Elemental.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Portrait_Lava_Elemental.png/50px-Portrait_Lava_Elemental.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lava Elemental\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Portrait_Lava_Elemental.png/25px-Portrait_Lava_Elemental.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Portrait_Lava_Elemental.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lava_Elemental\" title=\"Lava Elemental\">Lava Elemental</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Water_Elemental\" title=\"Water Elemental\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Portrait_Water_Elemental.png/25px-Portrait_Water_Elemental.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Portrait_Water_Elemental.png/38px-Portrait_Water_Elemental.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Portrait_Water_Elemental.png/50px-Portrait_Water_Elemental.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Water Elemental\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Portrait_Water_Elemental.png/25px-Portrait_Water_Elemental.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Portrait_Water_Elemental.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Water_Elemental\" title=\"Water Elemental\">Water Elemental</a> near the entrance</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The gloves given by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glut\" title=\"Glut\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png/25px-Portrait_Glut.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png/38px-Portrait_Glut.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png/50px-Portrait_Glut.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Glut\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png/25px-Portrait_Glut.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Glut\" title=\"Glut\">Glut</a> and the ones sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Esther\" title=\"Esther\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png/25px-Portrait_Esther.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png/38px-Portrait_Esther.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png/50px-Portrait_Esther.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lady Esther\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png/25px-Portrait_Esther.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Esther\" title=\"Esther\">Lady Esther</a> are mutually exclusive: if the party gets one, the other does not appear.</li></ul>\n\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 300px\">\n\t\t\t